# Income Statement — Additional Information GST

## Scope

Same date window as the Income Statement header (e.g. FY **01/07/2025–30/06/2026**).

| Line | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| GST Collected (1A) | Taxable sales in period ÷ 11 |
| GST Claimable (1B) | Claimable purchases in period ÷ 11 (GST-free / ATO refund excluded) |
| Net GST (1A − 1B) | Period book estimate — **not** one annual ATO remittance |

## Confirmed SELPIC FY 2025–26

| Field | Amount | OK? |
|-------|--------|-----|
| GST Collected | **$1,310.86** | Yes (FY 1A) |
| GST Claimable | **$563.83** | Yes (FY 1B) |
| Net GST | **$747.03** | Yes (1,310.86 − 563.83) |

Cross-check with cash P&L: CTR / ex-GST Net (~−$1,674) + FY Net GST (~+$747) ≈ cash Net (−$927.13).

## Do not confuse with

| Screen | Window | Role |
|--------|--------|------|
| **Reports → BAS vs ATO Lodgment** | **One BAS quarter** | Match Online Services lodgment |
| **Reports → Income Statement Additional Info** | **Same as P&L (often FY)** | Period GST estimate |
| **Balance Sheet GST Payable** | **Latest BAS still due** | Liability (e.g. Q4 ~$765), not FY $747 |

## Do not

- Treat FY $747.03 as the amount to type into one quarterly BAS
- Expect BAS block to show FY totals (BAS lodging is quarterly by ATO design)
- Subtract ATO bank refund (~$18) from FY 1B / Net in this card
